(function(window2){"use strict";var validStates="AC AL AM AP BA CE DF ES GO MA MG MS MT PA PB PE PI PR RJ RN RO RR RS SC SE SP TO".split(" ");var filterKeys=["distancia","tempo","rua","trail","nacional","internacional","cupom","badges","periodo_inicio","periodo_fim"];var defaults={distancia:"1,42",tempo:"0,12",rua:"true",trail:"true",nacional:"true",internacional:"false",cupom:"false",badges:"",periodo_inicio:"",periodo_fim:""};function normalizeFilter(key,value){if(value===null||value===void 0||value==="")value=defaults[key];value=String(value).trim();if(["rua","trail","nacional","internacional","cupom"].indexOf(key)>=0){return/^(true|yes|1)$/i.test(value)?"true":"false"}if(key==="distancia"||key==="tempo"){var parts=value.split(",").filter(function(part){return part.trim()!==""});return Number(parts[0])+","+Number(parts[parts.length-1])}return value}function acceptsFilters(href,filters){if(!filters)return false;var source=new URL(href);return filterKeys.every(function(key){return normalizeFilter(key,source.searchParams.get(key))===normalizeFilter(key,filters[key])})}function buildUrl(href,uf,slug){uf=String(uf||"").toUpperCase();slug=String(slug||"");if(validStates.indexOf(uf)<0||slug&&!/^[a-z0-9-]+$/.test(slug))return"";var source=new URL(href);var target=new URL("/estado/"+uf.toLowerCase()+"/"+(slug?slug+"/":""),source.origin);filterKeys.forEach(function(key){var value=source.searchParams.get(key);if(value!==null&&value!=="")target.searchParams.set(key,value)});return target.pathname+target.search}function normalize(value){return String(value||"").normalize("NFD").replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,"").toLowerCase().trim().replace(/\s+/g," ")}function matches(name,term){return normalize(name).indexOf(normalize(term))>=0}function init(document,uf,selected){var statePicker=document.querySelector("[data-estado-state-picker]");var cityPicker=document.querySelector("[data-estado-city-picker]");var pickers=[statePicker,cityPicker].filter(Boolean);var cityItems=cityPicker?cityPicker.querySelectorAll("[data-estado-city-slug]"):[];var sidebar=document.querySelector("[data-estado-city-sidebar]");function filterPicker(picker){var input=picker.querySelector("[data-estado-picker-search]");var status=picker.querySelector("[data-estado-state-status], [data-estado-city-status]");var visible=0;picker.querySelectorAll("[data-estado-picker-item]").forEach(function(item){var found=matches(item.dataset.estadoPickerName,input?input.value:"");item.hidden=!found;if(found)visible++});if(status)status.textContent=visible?"":picker===statePicker?"Nenhum estado encontrado.":"Nenhuma cidade encontrada."}function syncLinks(){if(statePicker){statePicker.querySelectorAll("[data-estado-state]").forEach(function(item){item.href=buildUrl(window2.location.href,item.dataset.estadoState,"")})}document.querySelectorAll("[data-estado-city-slug]").forEach(function(item){if(item.getAttribute("aria-disabled")!=="true")item.href=buildUrl(window2.location.href,uf,item.dataset.estadoCitySlug)})}pickers.forEach(function(picker){var input=picker.querySelector("[data-estado-picker-search]");var summary=picker.querySelector("summary");picker.addEventListener("toggle",function(){if(picker.open){pickers.forEach(function(otherPicker){if(otherPicker!==picker)otherPicker.open=false});syncLinks();if(input)input.focus()}else if(input){input.value="";filterPicker(picker)}});if(input)input.addEventListener("input",function(){filterPicker(picker)});picker.addEventListener("keydown",function(event){if(event.key==="Escape"){picker.open=false;if(summary)summary.focus()}})});document.addEventListener("click",function(event){pickers.forEach(function(picker){if(!picker.contains(event.target))picker.open=false});var stateLink=event.target.closest("[data-estado-state]");if(stateLink)stateLink.href=buildUrl(window2.location.href,stateLink.dataset.estadoState,"");var cityLink=event.target.closest("[data-estado-city-slug]");if(cityLink&&cityLink.getAttribute("aria-disabled")!=="true")cityLink.href=buildUrl(window2.location.href,uf,cityLink.dataset.estadoCitySlug)});window2.RunnerHubEstadoCities.update=function(data){if(!data||String(data.uf).toLowerCase()!==String(uf).toLowerCase()||!Array.isArray(data.cities)||!acceptsFilters(window2.location.href,data.filters))return;var counts={};data.cities.forEach(function(city){counts[city.slug]=city});cityItems.forEach(function(item){var slug=item.dataset.estadoCitySlug;var total=slug?counts[slug]?counts[slug].total:0:data.total;var enabled=total>0||slug===""||slug===selected;var count=item.querySelector("[data-city-count]");if(count)count.textContent=total+(total===1?" prova":" provas");item.setAttribute("aria-disabled",enabled?"false":"true");if(enabled){item.href=buildUrl(window2.location.href,uf,slug);item.removeAttribute("tabindex")}else{item.removeAttribute("href");item.setAttribute("tabindex","-1")}});if(sidebar){sidebar.textContent="";data.cities.filter(function(city){return city.total>0}).sort(function(a,b){return b.total-a.total||a.name.localeCompare(b.name,"pt-BR")}).slice(0,10).forEach(function(city){var link=document.createElement("a");link.className="estado-city-list-item";link.dataset.estadoCitySlug=city.slug;link.href=buildUrl(window2.location.href,uf,city.slug);var name=document.createElement("span");name.className="estado-city-list-name";name.textContent=city.name;var count=document.createElement("span");count.className="estado-city-list-count";count.textContent=city.total+(city.total===1?" prova":" provas");link.append(name,count);sidebar.appendChild(link)});sidebar.parentElement.hidden=!sidebar.children.length}if(cityPicker)filterPicker(cityPicker)};syncLinks()}window2.RunnerHubEstadoCities={buildUrl,matches,acceptsFilters,init}})(window);
